From: Cosmo Zhao <yuszhao@blackberry.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jul 2024 16:01:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] add libregex dependency to test

QNX: link ruy's test wrapper with libregex.

From qnx-ports/ruy (c08ec529fc91...qnx, commit "add libregex dependency to
test"). googletest uses regcomp()/regexec(), which QNX
keeps in libregex rather than libc. The fork's other commits switch the
cpuinfo and googletest submodules to qnx-ports' forks; this recipe builds
against the cpuinfo port instead (RUY_FIND_CPUINFO=ON), so they are left out.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

diff --git a/ruy/CMakeLists.txt b/ruy/CMakeLists.txt
index 8e493de8f85..200095f7de7 100644
--- a/ruy/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/ruy/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -48,15 +48,28 @@ ruy_cc_library(
     ${ruy_2_O3}
 )
 
-ruy_cc_library(
-  NAME
-    ruy_gtest_wrapper
-  TESTONLY
-  HDRS
-    gtest_wrapper.h
-  DEPS
-    gtest
-)
+if (QNX)
+  ruy_cc_library(
+    NAME
+      ruy_gtest_wrapper
+    TESTONLY
+    HDRS
+      gtest_wrapper.h
+    DEPS
+      gtest
+      regex
+  )
+else()
+  ruy_cc_library(
+    NAME
+      ruy_gtest_wrapper
+    TESTONLY
+    HDRS
+      gtest_wrapper.h
+    DEPS
+      gtest
+  )
+endif()
 
 ruy_cc_library(
   NAME
